+  # Linux：socketowner 的 Wine 观察器运行时，WINE-PROCESS-* 匹配 Wine 连接背后的 Windows 程序，
+  # PROCESS-* 仍匹配持有套接字的进程（如沙箱的 pasta）。无法确定程序时为 wine-unknown
+  # Linux: with socketowner's Wine observer running, WINE-PROCESS-* match the Windows program
+  # behind a Wine connection, while PROCESS-* still match the process holding the socket (such as a
+  # sandbox's pasta). A program that can't be established is wine-unknown.
+  - AND,((PROCESS-NAME-REGEX,^game-pasta(\.avx2)?$),(WINE-PROCESS-NAME,game.exe)),DIRECT
+  - WINE-PROCESS-PATH-WILDCARD,C:\Games\*,DIRECT
   # 当满足条件是 TCP 或 UDP 流量时，使用名为 sub-rule-name1 的规则集
   - SUB-RULE,(OR,((NETWORK,TCP),(NETWORK,UDP))),sub-rule-name1
   - SUB-RULE,(AND,((NETWORK,UDP))),sub-rule-name2
